//
//   - `action` — historic action-manifest gate (default).
//   - `comms_send` — `aileron-mcp`'s `send_message` tool;
//     args carry `service`, `channel`, `body`.
//   - `comms_draft` — `aileron-mcp`'s `draft_reply` tool;
